{"4580790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mine Mage Minion", "steam_appid": 4580790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4796620], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.poster.avif?t=1786496397\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.webm?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.mp4?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a mage digging <strong>deeper and deeper into the earth</strong>. As you mine, you collect resources that can be forged into <strong>guns, armor, and equipment</strong> for both yourself and your minions. Your minions work alongside you, and you must manage them carefully. They can also be equipped with their own armor and gear to survive the dangers below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.poster.avif?t=1786496397\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.webm?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.mp4?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dig, the more dangerous the world becomes. In deeper levels, <strong>waves of enemies begin to appear</strong>, and powerful <strong>bosses start emerging</strong> from the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also manage your miners by paying them wages and keeping their <strong>motivation high</strong>, or their efficiency will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is not your only problem. Various <strong>flying creatures and pests</strong> try to sabotage your progress. For example, crows might swoop in to <strong>destroy crops or resources you are growing</strong>, or even <strong>carry away your minions</strong> if you are not careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on how well you <strong>mine, craft, defend your operation, and lead your growing workforce</strong> as the depths become increasingly hostile.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.poster.avif?t=1786496397\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.webm?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/2a27705f869093c85af0b76a11335c1a.mp4?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a mage digging <strong>deeper and deeper into the earth</strong>. As you mine, you collect resources that can be forged into <strong>guns, armor, and equipment</strong> for both yourself and your minions. Your minions work alongside you, and you must manage them carefully. They can also be equipped with their own armor and gear to survive the dangers below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.poster.avif?t=1786496397\" width=720 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.webm?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580790/extras/ba140379fe1974601a20687522a81289.mp4?t=1786496397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you dig, the more dangerous the world becomes. In deeper levels, <strong>waves of enemies begin to appear</strong>, and powerful <strong>bosses start emerging</strong> from the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must also manage your miners by paying them wages and keeping their <strong>motivation high</strong>, or their efficiency will drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is not your only problem. Various <strong>flying creatures and pests</strong> try to sabotage your progress. For example, crows might swoop in to <strong>destroy crops or resources you are growing</strong>, or even <strong>carry away your minions</strong> if you are not careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival depends on how well you <strong>mine, craft, defend your operation, and lead your growing workforce</strong> as the depths become increasingly hostile.</p>", "short_description": "A mining game where you play as a mage digging deeper into the earth. Gather resources, craft weapons and armor for yourself and your minions, defend your operation from enemy waves and bosses, and protect your underground colony from creatures trying to sabotage your progress.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Turkish, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor